WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
Are you watching a WandVision, Andy?

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:03.660
Have you seen the show yet?

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:04.493
I have not.

00:00:04.493 --> 00:00:05.570
I'm gonna tell you, it's fantastic.

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:08.120
It's one of those shows you
can watch with the whole family

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:11.520
and my kids love it and it's so well done.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.353
It's beautifully done.

00:00:12.353 --> 00:00:14.230
All right, I'll watch it with your kids.

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:15.770
I'd prefer you watched it-

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:18.300
No, my kids have seen it
and they watch it with me.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.510
I don't think you need to
watch it with my children.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:23.078
I'm getting mixed messages here.

00:00:23.078 --> 00:00:25.438
(laughing)

00:00:25.438 --> 00:00:26.271
Okay, all right.

00:00:26.271 --> 00:00:28.780
Well, maybe I'll come over to your house

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:29.720
and I'll watch it with you.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:30.553
How's that?

00:00:30.553 --> 00:00:32.000
And we'll leave the kids out of it.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.110
Okay.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:33.943
[Conan] All right.

00:00:33.943 --> 00:00:34.956
I'm lonely.

00:00:34.956 --> 00:00:36.770
(laughing)

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:39.530
Why do you say it in such a happy way?

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:40.440
I don't know.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.380
I'm excited about having you come over.

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:45.110
Are you feeling a little more optimistic

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:47.430
about the the whole pandemic thing now?

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:48.650
Don't you feel?

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.110
I got to say every day that goes by

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:52.630
I think we're getting closer
towards the end of this thing.

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:53.670
Is that possible?

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:55.560
Well, I mean there, isn't it like,

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:58.080
they're vaccinating a
million people a day now?

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:01.120
That's got to make a difference.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:02.690
Yeah and now they have a third,

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:06.545
there's a third vaccine,
the Johnson &amp; Johnson.

00:01:06.545 --> 00:01:07.646
Fantastic.

00:01:07.646 --> 00:01:10.130
I think they should
just go down the street

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.886
darting people with the vaccine.

00:01:11.886 --> 00:01:13.140
Wouldn't it be great.

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:13.973
I'd love it.

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:15.810
You and I have not been vaccinated yet.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:17.550
I'd love it if that was
just walking down the street

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:19.793
on my way to get a frozen yogurt.

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:22.840
Ah, vaccinated.

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:23.673
Ah.

00:01:23.673 --> 00:01:24.506
[Conan] Hey, you know?

00:01:24.506 --> 00:01:25.970
Yeah, thank you.

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:28.810
Yeah, but as I said last night

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:32.780
we got to wait until our category comes up

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:34.400
and you know what that category is.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:35.410
Tell 'em.

00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:37.343
National treasures.

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:40.493
[Andy] Yeah.

00:01:41.890 --> 00:01:43.161
That would be.

00:01:43.161 --> 00:01:45.411
(laughing)

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:47.103
I just love the idea

00:01:47.103 --> 00:01:49.380
that anyone watching at home
would get angry at that.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:50.370
[Andy] Yeah, yeah.

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:52.270
You're not a national treasure.

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:53.653
Who do you think you are?

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:56.120
And you know what, people say,

00:01:56.120 --> 00:02:00.470
oh, I really miss socializing,
going to the clubs,

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:01.500
things like that.

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:03.400
I didn't do those things before COVID.

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:05.313
No.

00:02:05.313 --> 00:02:08.290
No one wanted me to go
to the clubs with them.

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:09.190
No.

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:10.960
Yeah, you've been practicing.

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:11.793
Yeah.

00:02:11.793 --> 00:02:12.626
[Andy] Yeah.

00:02:12.626 --> 00:02:13.459
Yeah, I was practicing for COVID

00:02:13.459 --> 00:02:15.020
long before COVID came along.

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:15.853
[Andy] Right.

00:02:15.853 --> 00:02:20.853
Sona, did anyone ever want
me to go clubbing with them?

00:02:31.277 --> 00:02:32.110
Okay, all right.

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:33.860
You could've just said no to no clubbing.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:34.693
You didn't have to say

00:02:34.693 --> 00:02:36.950
no one ever wanted you to go anywhere.

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:37.783
All right.

00:02:37.783 --> 00:02:40.573
Just stay back behind that curtain, okay?

00:02:40.573 --> 00:02:41.860
No reason for you to come out.

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:44.763
Yeah.

